Models
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Etho calls Meta models (SAM 3.1, Muse Spark, Muse Spark Open) through their
hosted APIs. No model weights are distributed in this repository.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets (not redistributed, except one 60 s CalMS21 clip for the offline demo; download instructions in README)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CalMS21: Caltech Mouse Social Interactions dataset, CC BY 4.0.
  Sun, J. J., Karigo, T., Chakraborty, D., Mohanty, S. P., Wild, B., Sun, Q.,
  Chen, C., Anderson, D. J., Perona, P., Yue, Y., Kennedy, A. "The Multi-Agent
  Behavior Dataset: Mouse Dyadic Social Interactions." NeurIPS Datasets and
  Benchmarks 2021. arXiv:2104.02710. Data: https://data.caltech.edu/records/s0vdx-0k302
  Redistributed excerpt: demo/sample/calms21_dev_60s.mp4 (dev-split mouse008, 270-330 s, re-encoded), CC BY 4.0;
  see demo/sample/CREDITS.md.
  Behavior definitions quoted from Segalin, C., et al. "The Mouse Action
  Recognition System (MARS) software pipeline for automated analysis of social
  behaviors in mice." eLife 10:e63720 (2021). doi:10.7554/eLife.63720
  Any CalMS21 annotation shown in Etho's materials is an excerpt rendered as a
  timeline, credited to the authors above, otherwise unmodified.

Fly vs. Fly (Aggression subset): CC0 (public domain dedication).
  Eyjolfsdottir, E., Branson, S., Burgos-Artizzu, X. P., Hoopfer, E. D.,
  Schor, J., Anderson, D. J., Perona, P. "Detecting Social Actions of Fruit
  Flies." ECCV 2014, LNCS 8690. doi:10.1007/978-3-319-10605-2_50.
  Data: CaltechDATA, doi:10.22002/D1.1893
  Fly behavior definitions quoted from Chen, S., Lee, A. Y., Bowens, N. M.,
  Huber, R., Kravitz, E. A. "Fighting fruit flies: a model system for the study
  of aggression." PNAS 99(8):5664-5668 (2002). doi:10.1073/pnas.082102599
